{"title":"Career Roadmap · Marketing Manager","role":"Marketing Manager","summary":"A Marketing Manager plans and executes a company's marketing strategy to grow brand awareness, customer acquisition, revenue, market share, and customer retention. The role combines consumer research, branding, digital marketing, campaigns, analytics, pricing, content, and business strategy.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"Integrated Programme in Management (IPM – BBA+MBA)"},"about":[{"label":"Important","text":"Marketing Manager is generally a mid-level role, not an immediate graduate position. The IPM route can accelerate progression because it combines undergraduate management education with an MBA-level curriculum, but relevant internships and measurable marketing experience remain essential."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus","What changes"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Management foundations"},{"text":"Marketing, economics, accounting, consumer behaviour"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Marketing execution"},{"text":"Digital marketing, campaigns, research, analytics"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Marketing ownership"},{"text":"Campaign budgets, channels, products and KPIs"}],[{"text":"2033–2036"},{"text":"Marketing management"},{"text":"Brand/category ownership and team leadership"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Strategic marketing"},{"text":"Portfolio, growth strategy and market expansion"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Executive leadership"},{"text":"Marketing Director / VP Marketing / CMO"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build this","Key skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business fundamentals"},{"text":"Marketing, economics, accounting, communication"},{"text":"Market research project"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Marketing foundations"},{"text":"STP, consumer behaviour, branding"},{"text":"Marketing campaign"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Digital & analytics"},{"text":"SEO, paid media, Excel, analytics"},{"text":"Digital campaign internship"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Strategic marketing"},{"text":"Brand strategy, research, pricing"},{"text":"Marketing strategy project"}],[{"text":"Year 5"},{"text":"Advanced management"},{"text":"Marketing analytics, strategy, leadership"},{"text":"Brand/growth internship"}],[{"text":"Year 6"},{"text":"MBA-level execution"},{"text":"Budgeting, leadership, integrated campaigns"},{"text":"Major consulting/capstone project"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Because an IPM programme integrates undergraduate and postgraduate management education, the exact year structure varies by institution. The roadmap should therefore be treated as a capability progression, not a fixed semester syllabus."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Business Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a strong base in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of Management"},{"text":"Marketing Fundamentals"},{"text":"Microeconomics"},{"text":"Macroeconomics"},{"text":"Financial Accounting"},{"text":"Business Mathematics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Organizational Behaviour"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn how businesses make money"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Market","Customer","Product","Marketing","Sale","Revenue","Profit"]},{"type":"p","text":"Marketing should never be treated as only advertising."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Core Marketing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"STP"},{"type":"h","text":"Segmentation"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Divide the market into meaningful customer groups."},{"type":"h","text":"Targeting"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Select the customer segment to serve."},{"type":"h","text":"Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Define how the product should be perceived relative to alternatives."},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing mix"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product","Price","Place","Promotion"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For services, also understand the extended marketing mix."},{"type":"h","text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer needs"},{"text":"Purchase decisions"},{"text":"Motivation"},{"text":"Perception"},{"text":"Customer journeys"},{"text":"Brand preferences"},{"text":"Behavioural economics"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Branding"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brand identity"},{"text":"Brand positioning"},{"text":"Brand architecture"},{"text":"Brand personality"},{"text":"Brand equity"},{"text":"Brand awareness"},{"text":"Brand recall"},{"text":"Customer loyalty"},{"text":"Competitive positioning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Select an existing brand and create:"},{"type":"h","text":"Brand Audit"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Target customers"},{"text":"Positioning"},{"text":"Competitors"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Customer reviews"},{"text":"Brand strengths"},{"text":"Brand weaknesses"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Digital Marketing & Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical digital skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"SEM"},{"text":"Social media marketing"},{"text":"Content marketing"},{"text":"Email marketing"},{"text":"Influencer marketing"},{"text":"Affiliate marketing"},{"text":"Performance marketing"},{"text":"E-commerce marketing"},{"text":"Marketing automation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advertising"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Ads concepts"},{"text":"Social advertising"},{"text":"Campaign objectives"},{"text":"Audience targeting"},{"text":"Creative testing"},{"text":"Conversion tracking"},{"text":"Attribution"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Platform interfaces and advertising rules change frequently, so practical training should use current platform documentation."},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Dashboarding"},{"text":"Forecasting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing dashboard"},{"text":"Sales funnel dashboard"},{"text":"Campaign performance dashboard"},{"text":"Customer segmentation dashboard"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"p","text":"SELECT"},{"type":"p","text":"WHERE"},{"type":"p","text":"GROUP BY"},{"type":"p","text":"JOIN"},{"type":"p","text":"CASE"},{"type":"p","text":"CTE"},{"type":"p","text":"Window Functions"},{"type":"h","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean/median"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"A/B testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Marketing Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Move beyond individual campaigns."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Competitive analysis"},{"text":"Pricing strategy"},{"text":"Product-market fit"},{"text":"Go-to-market strategy"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"},{"text":"Customer retention"},{"text":"Brand strategy"},{"text":"Marketing budgets"},{"text":"Channel strategy"},{"text":"Marketing ROI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Go-to-Market framework"},{"type":"h","text":"Market"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer"},{"type":"h","text":"Problem"},{"type":"h","text":"Product"},{"type":"h","text":"Positioning"},{"type":"h","text":"Pricing"},{"type":"h","text":"Distribution"},{"type":"h","text":"Promotion"},{"type":"h","text":"Measurement"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 5 — Advanced MBA-Level Marketing"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop stronger commercial skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strategic marketing"},{"text":"Consumer insights"},{"text":"Brand management"},{"text":"Product management"},{"text":"Sales & marketing alignment"},{"text":"Marketing finance"},{"text":"Revenue management"},{"text":"Customer lifetime value"},{"text":"Customer experience"},{"text":"Integrated marketing communications"},{"text":"Marketing technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Financial understanding"},{"type":"p","text":"Know:"},{"type":"h","text":"CAC"},{"type":"p","text":"Customer Acquisition Cost"},{"type":"h","text":"LTV"},{"type":"p","text":"Customer Lifetime Value"},{"type":"h","text":"Conversion Rate"},{"type":"h","text":"Retention Rate"},{"type":"h","text":"Churn"},{"type":"h","text":"ROAS"},{"type":"p","text":"Return on Ad Spend"},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing ROI"},{"type":"p","text":"A marketing manager must understand whether marketing activity produces profitable growth, not merely impressions."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 6 — Leadership & Business Ownership"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing budget management"},{"text":"Team leadership"},{"text":"Agency management"},{"text":"Vendor management"},{"text":"Executive reporting"},{"text":"Cross-functional collaboration"},{"text":"Crisis communication"},{"text":"Marketing governance"},{"text":"Strategic planning"},{"text":"Annual marketing planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Integrated campaign"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a complete campaign covering:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","Strategy","Creative","Media","Conversion","Retention","Analytics"]},{"type":"p","text":"This should become the flagship portfolio project."}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Key skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Brand Marketing"},{"text":"Positioning, campaigns, consumer insights"}],[{"text":"Digital Marketing"},{"text":"SEO, paid media, analytics"}],[{"text":"Performance Marketing"},{"text":"CAC, ROAS, conversion optimisation"}],[{"text":"Product Marketing"},{"text":"Positioning, launches, GTM"}],[{"text":"Content Marketing"},{"text":"Content strategy, SEO, storytelling"}],[{"text":"Social Media Marketing"},{"text":"Community, content, paid social"}],[{"text":"Growth Marketing"},{"text":"Experimentation, acquisition, retention"}],[{"text":"B2B Marketing"},{"text":"Lead generation, ABM, sales alignment"}],[{"text":"E-commerce Marketing"},{"text":"Conversion, merchandising, marketplace"}],[{"text":"Market Research"},{"text":"Surveys, consumer insights, analytics"}],[{"text":"CRM/Lifecycle Marketing"},{"text":"Retention, segmentation, automation"}],[{"text":"International Marketing"},{"text":"Global markets, localisation"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Best internship sequence"},{"type":"h","text":"Early stage"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing Intern"},{"text":"Social Media Intern"},{"text":"Market Research Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Middle stage"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital Marketing Intern"},{"text":"Brand Management Intern"},{"text":"Growth Marketing Intern"},{"text":"Product Marketing Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced IPM stage"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brand Management"},{"text":"Marketing Strategy"},{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"Product Marketing"},{"text":"Consumer Insights"},{"text":"Management Consulting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong internship targets"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FMCG companies"},{"text":"E-commerce companies"},{"text":"Technology companies"},{"text":"Consumer brands"},{"text":"Financial services"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Advertising agencies"},{"text":"D2C brands"},{"text":"Startups"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong Internship Project"},{"type":"h","text":"End-to-End Brand Growth Campaign"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a real or hypothetical product."},{"type":"h","text":"Step 1 — Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market size"},{"text":"Customer segments"},{"text":"Competitors"},{"text":"Customer pain points"},{"text":"Search trends"},{"text":"Reviews"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Step 2 — Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Define:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Target segment"},{"text":"Positioning"},{"text":"Value proposition"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Channels"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Step 3 — Campaign"},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Landing page"},{"text":"Social content"},{"text":"Search campaign"},{"text":"Email campaign"},{"text":"Short-form video"},{"text":"Influencer strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Step 4 — Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Impressions"},{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"CPC"},{"text":"Leads"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"ROAS"},{"text":"Retention"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Step 5 — Optimisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Conduct A/B tests on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Headlines"},{"text":"Creatives"},{"text":"CTAs"},{"text":"Landing pages"},{"text":"Audience segments"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["This demonstrates strategy","execution","analytics."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital marketing"},{"text":"Brand management"},{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Product marketing"},{"text":"Growth marketing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Marketing analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advertising"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn current platform certifications/training for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Search advertising"},{"text":"Social advertising"},{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Marketing automation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Later-career options:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Product management"},{"text":"Strategic management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certification value depends on the target role; internships and measurable campaign results generally carry more weight for early marketing hiring."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Entry-level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing Executive"},{"text":"Marketing Analyst"},{"text":"Digital Marketing Executive"},{"text":"Brand Executive"},{"text":"Marketing Associate"},{"text":"Growth Marketing Associate"},{"text":"Product Marketing Associate"},{"text":"Market Research Analyst"},{"text":"Social Media Executive"},{"text":"CRM Marketing Associate"},{"text":"Management Trainee"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mid-level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Assistant Marketing Manager"},{"text":"Brand Manager"},{"text":"Digital Marketing Manager"},{"text":"Growth Marketing Manager"},{"text":"Product Marketing Manager"},{"text":"Category Marketing Manager"},{"text":"CRM Manager"},{"text":"Marketing Analytics Manager"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Senior"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Marketing Manager"},{"text":"Marketing Director"},{"text":"Head of Marketing"},{"text":"VP Marketing"},{"text":"Chief Marketing Officer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Interview Questions"},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is STP?"},{"text":"How would you position a new product?"},{"text":"What makes a strong brand?"},{"text":"How would you conduct market research?"},{"text":"How would you identify a target audience?"},{"text":"How would you launch a new product?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is CAC?"},{"text":"What is ROAS?"},{"text":"How would you improve conversion rate?"},{"text":"What is SEO?"},{"text":"How would you evaluate a paid campaign?"},{"text":"How would you design an A/B test?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strategy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"A competitor cuts its price by 20%. What would you do?"},{"text":"How would you enter a new market?"},{"text":"How would you allocate a limited marketing budget?"},{"text":"How would you measure brand awareness?"},{"text":"How would you balance short-term sales with long-term brand building?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Leadership"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How would you manage an external marketing agency?"},{"text":"How would you resolve disagreement between sales and marketing?"},{"text":"How would you present an underperforming campaign to senior management?"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The IPM already incorporates an MBA stage, so a separate MBA immediately after completing the integrated programme is generally unnecessary."},{"type":"p","text":"After IPM, useful advanced directions include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing Analytics"},{"text":"Consumer Insights"},{"text":"Brand Management"},{"text":"Digital Marketing"},{"text":"Product Management"},{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"Business Analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A later specialised master's or executive programme should be pursued only when it provides a clear career advantage."},{"type":"h","text":"Government / Public-Sector Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Marketing-related public-sector opportunities can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public-sector marketing"},{"text":"Government communication"},{"text":"Public campaigns"},{"text":"Tourism marketing"},{"text":"Public-sector brand management"},{"text":"Government-owned enterprises"},{"text":"Public information campaigns"},{"text":"Marketing/communications roles in public institutions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Recruitment depends on the organisation and current notification."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant postgraduate programmes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Marketing"},{"text":"MSc Digital Marketing"},{"text":"MSc Marketing Analytics"},{"text":"MSc Consumer Behaviour"},{"text":"MSc Brand Management"},{"text":"MSc International Marketing"},{"text":"MSc Strategic Marketing"},{"text":"MBA Marketing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful destinations include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Germany"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For an IPM graduate, choose an international programme only when it adds specialisation, international exposure, network, or a strong recruiting advantage beyond the existing MBA."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Marketing Executive / Management Trainee"},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing Associate / Brand Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"Assistant Marketing Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing Manager / Brand Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Marketing Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of Marketing"},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing Director / VP Marketing"},{"type":"h","text":"Chief Marketing Officer"}]},{"heading":"Brand Management Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A classic FMCG/consumer-business pathway is:"},{"type":"h","text":"Brand Executive"},{"type":"flow","items":["Assistant Brand Manager","Brand Manager","Senior Brand Manager","Marketing Director","CMO"]},{"type":"p","text":"Skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Consumer insights"},{"text":"Brand positioning"},{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"Product portfolio"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Promotions"},{"text":"P&L"},{"text":"Market research"}]}]},{"heading":"Growth Marketing Route","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For technology and startups:"},{"type":"h","text":"Growth Associate"},{"type":"flow","items":["Growth Manager","Senior Growth Manager","Head of Growth","VP Growth / CMO"]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Acquisition"},{"text":"Activation"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Referral"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Experimentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A useful framework is:"},{"type":"h","text":"AARRR"},{"type":"flow","items":["Acquisition","Activation","Retention","Referral","Revenue"]}]},{"heading":"Product Marketing Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is increasingly important in technology companies."},{"type":"h","text":"Product Marketing Associate"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product Marketing Manager","Senior Product Marketing Manager","Director Product Marketing"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer research"},{"text":"Competitive intelligence"},{"text":"Product positioning"},{"text":"Messaging"},{"text":"Go-to-market"},{"text":"Product launches"},{"text":"Sales enablement"},{"text":"Customer feedback"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product","Marketing","Sales","Customer"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"AI and Future of Marketing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will significantly change marketing execution."},{"type":"h","text":"AI can support"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Content generation"},{"text":"Campaign personalisation"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"Lead scoring"},{"text":"Recommendation systems"},{"text":"Customer-service automation"},{"text":"Ad creative testing"},{"text":"Marketing forecasting"},{"text":"Churn prediction"},{"text":"Customer journey optimisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional marketing"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","Campaign","Launch","Analyse"]},{"type":"h","text":"AI-enabled marketing"},{"type":"flow","items":["Real-time customer data","AI segmentation","Personalised content","Automated experimentation","Predictive optimisation","Continuous learning"]},{"type":"p","text":"The Marketing Manager will increasingly become an AI-enabled growth and customer strategist, rather than simply a campaign manager."}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Future marketing leadership will increasingly involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI marketing agents"},{"text":"Real-time customer intelligence"},{"text":"Hyper-personalisation"},{"text":"Predictive customer journeys"},{"text":"Automated media optimisation"},{"text":"Synthetic consumer research"},{"text":"Generative creative systems"},{"text":"Privacy-preserving customer analytics"},{"text":"Immersive/3D brand experiences"},{"text":"Autonomous marketing workflows"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strategic question will move from:"},{"type":"h","text":"“Which campaign should we run?”"},{"type":"p","text":"to:"},{"type":"h","text":"“How should we continuously optimise the entire customer lifecycle?”"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Marketing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"STP"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Brand management"},{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Marketing strategy"},{"text":"Product marketing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Paid media"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Content marketing"},{"text":"Email/CRM"},{"text":"E-commerce"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Marketing attribution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Commercial"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"LTV"},{"text":"ROAS"},{"text":"Marketing ROI"},{"text":"Budgeting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Marketing automation"},{"text":"Analytics platforms"},{"text":"AI tools"},{"text":"Customer-data platforms"},{"text":"Generative AI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Leadership"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Team management"},{"text":"Agency management"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Strategic decision-making"},{"text":"Executive communication"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Integrated IPM (BBA + MBA)"},{"type":"flow","items":["Marketing Internship","Marketing Executive / Management Trainee","Brand/Marketing Associate","Assistant Marketing Manager","Marketing Manager","Senior Marketing Manager","Head of Marketing","Marketing Director / VP","Chief Marketing Officer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong IPM graduate should have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Integrated BBA + MBA in Management"},{"text":"2–3 strong marketing internships"},{"text":"Brand strategy knowledge"},{"text":"Consumer research capability"},{"text":"Digital marketing skills"},{"text":"Performance marketing understanding"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Marketing analytics"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"CRM and marketing automation"},{"text":"Financial and marketing ROI understanding"},{"text":"Strong presentation and communication skills"},{"text":"One complete end-to-end marketing campaign"},{"text":"One strong brand/consumer research project"},{"text":"AI-enabled marketing knowledge"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["IPM (BBA+MBA)","Marketing/Brand Internship","Consumer Insights","Digital Marketing","Marketing Analytics","Brand Strategy","Financial/ROI Understanding","AI-enabled Growth Marketing","Leadership."],"sep":"+","label":"Ideal profile"},{"type":"h","text":"1288 | BBA / BMS / BBM | BBA – FinTech | FinTech Associate"}]}]}